# iubenda

> All-in-one legal compliance platform for websites, apps, and organizations. Covers privacy policies, cookie consent banners, terms & conditions, whistleblowing, and accessibility — lawyer-crafted and automatically updated.

iubenda serves 150,000+ customers across 100+ countries. Founded in Milan in 2011, now part of the team.blue group. Compliance coverage includes EU & UK GDPR, CCPA/CPRA, LGPD, FADP, and the EU ePrivacy Directive. Plans start free and scale by number of sites and apps. iubenda provides compliance tools and lawyer-drafted document templates — it is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice.

## Products

- [Privacy & Cookie Policy Generator](https://www.iubenda.com/en/privacy-policy/): Generate lawyer-drafted, multilingual privacy and cookie policies for websites and apps. Documents update automatically when regulations change.
- [Cookie Consent Banner & CMP](https://www.iubenda.com/en/eprivacy-cookie-law-compliance/): Certified Consent Management Platform supporting IAB TCF 2.2 and Google Consent Mode v2, with consent logging and statistics.
- [Terms and Conditions Generator](https://www.iubenda.com/en/terms-and-conditions-generator/): Customizable, lawyer-drafted T&C for any business type including e-commerce and SaaS.
- [Whistleblowing Solution](https://www.iubenda.com/en/eu-whistleblower-directive-compliance/): Secure anonymous reporting channel for organizations with 50+ EU employees.
- [Privacy Scanner](https://www.iubenda.com/en/scan/): Free tool to audit a website's compliance status.

